excerpt: >-
  A practical guide to the cofounder equity split for Indian startup founders.
  Through Part 2 of the fictional Loopwise AI story, Prem Menon explains why
  50-50 often fails, how four questions set a fair split, and how vesting for
  cofounders, a one-year cliff and a shareholders' agreement protect both the
